{"3481040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Apocalypse Survivors", "steam_appid": 3481040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/4f45e483263098d19cefcf756e62624e.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/4f45e483263098d19cefcf756e62624e.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this age of a global viral outbreak, you are the next generation human of the “Alpha” Project, the hope for humanity's future. You are deployed to the frontlines of the zombie tide to reignite the hope of human survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/d5b4b628a106fb5802e40441b25c9fe9.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/d5b4b628a106fb5802e40441b25c9fe9.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lengthy storylines, no repetitive cutscenes. Step into this adventurous post-apocalyptic world. Choose your favorite character and pick up your preferred weapon! This is a game everyone will enjoy. Whether you're experienced or new to gaming, simply move, choose, and decide to experience the recurring joy of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/c9bc280fabae8f820c3c3f296e0975b1.avif?t=1780407121\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/1c12c35d74e0a58bb4f26c17a42a446a.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/1c12c35d74e0a58bb4f26c17a42a446a.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone hero, equipped with various talents and support skills. You can either focus on your favorite character to change their gear and unlock their ultimate abilities. How you combine your equipment and find your own preferred playstyle will be the challenge this post-apocalyptic world presents to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/2f879c78fd4e075366cf7ad5c8c95746.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a stoic warrior. He specializes in using katanas, pistols, and assault rifles. By traveling through a rift in time and space, he has gained dark powers, allowing him to wield unique moves with his katana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/76e8ec53319fbcaf38a6a591ff453244.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a wild warrior.and the grenade launcher is his favorite. Only he can use this heavy weapon, and his physical enhancement allows him to fire it in rapid succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/938c909144c266ffeecb6509289d5abb.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is agile and quick, excelling at launching surprise attacks. Proficient with daggers and automatic rapid-fire pistols, she is a highly-trained assassin whose specialty is throwing all kinds of throwing knives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a6ffcfac01f6db973fb7b7fe68e44398.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is exceptionally talented, possessing strength and a desire for conquest that surpasses that of men. She specializes in using revolvers and sniper rifles. Additionally, she knows how to use two revolvers simultaneously, and after her body is enhanced, she can fire a rapid round at all surrounding enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/238a392782c71233247954ed18bd23ed.avif?t=1780407121\" width=310 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She possesses a formidable constitution, endowed with health and mana far exceeding ordinary limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A master of the baseball bat and semi-auto pistol, she can electrify her baseballs with lightning to unleash devastating damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eccentric at heart, she refuses to be summoned as a follower to fight for others, but can learn talents to convert damage or reflect enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/5f6a4291bc5801a049638cd1e6ab6abd.avif?t=1780407121\" width=310 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a martial artist passionate about creating art, which may sound hard to comprehend. But when you learn about his fighting style, you'll understand. Every punch carries gale-force winds. His modified enhanced arm can fire bullets, allowing him to summon sharks on flat ground. He also experiments with a flamethrower, beloved by everyone in the post-apocalyptic world. His name is not Joker—he is Rugal, a hero who hopes to bring laughter to the end times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/974ecedd20c70e6c0a493744b47affac.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/974ecedd20c70e6c0a493744b47affac.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery Store:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Players can purchase equipment with random attributes through a mysterious figure. The quality of the equipment improves as the difficulty level of the game is increased. With sufficient currency, players can obtain better equipment, which gradually helps to enhance their progress in clearing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c97e6c7d2f5c4691e220495f31f489d.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/9c97e6c7d2f5c4691e220495f31f489d.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip Manufacturing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Players can manufacture chips that enhance attributes. These chips can be equipped onto weapons, significantly boosting the character's attributes. This makes character development much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/37d49b6e71a5e186c57d53f4c7d55e1f.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/37d49b6e71a5e186c57d53f4c7d55e1f.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Modification:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Players can modify equipment using specific items. Equipment can not only be drilled for sockets but also have their other attributes enhanced. When players obtain the desired equipment, they can purposefully upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/b02f0764781b526246bdf74892145715.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/b02f0764781b526246bdf74892145715.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Players can create multiple characters and can also change the names of these characters. By creating multiple characters, players can use their talents to allow these saved characters to follow the main character in battle and fight zombies in a random manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a1a6da103d74a53eb3bcf2918235bfd6.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/a1a6da103d74a53eb3bcf2918235bfd6.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Each character can fill up their talent tree. Talent points are earned from completing tasks, killing zombies, collecting boxes, and purchasing items. The talents of different characters will vary slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c527afd85b28fdcb6cb7d43693573e2.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/9c527afd85b28fdcb6cb7d43693573e2.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Characters can carry two different weapons, a single weapon, or two weapons of the same type, with different combinations yielding varied combat effects.<br>Melee: Can perform two attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/44b85454447191f65199c5eb7b152389.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged: Can accumulate chip energy faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/43a9afc3386167c16ebed2a18ebeab4c.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/43a9afc3386167c16ebed2a18ebeab4c.avif?t=1780407121 width=1560 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. As you progress through increasingly challenging levels, more powerful enemies will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/b04f9a27c83dd90ca9d763fecc1a7402.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>8. By defeating enemies or scavenging the battlefield, you can obtain equipment with different attributes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/66fef2468748edde4b97978af54e18db.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Upgrading grants random skills. Guardian skills differ from those of followers, as they can absorb damage dealt by nearby enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/14939a007e41775618967cde6e0627b2.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Embedding crafted chips can further enhance character attribute strength or equip additional talent skills and unexpected chip skills, unleashing greater damage by accumulating energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/2ecabed71e7afb68e2f7bbbe88dbae36.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11.Unknown area exploration is generated by a fully random mechanism. Challenge zones of different sizes by consuming fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/fe1aa062f117d34b7dffb09d11877c54.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/ca02fcb00b461d78e1663e5935717105.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/ca02fcb00b461d78e1663e5935717105.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially, we were a small team of close friends who wanted to create the kind of gameplay we loved and share it with everyone. Although my friends are still supporting me, the team has now become just me. However, I don’t see this as a sad thing. It has truly become an independent development effort. Over the past few months, I’ve continued to maintain my initial passion and gradually improved the game. I will keep developing it. I believe this won’t be my last independent game, and I will continue to create more games in the future. If you have any ideas about the direction of my game design, we look forward to your feedback on my Discord. If you are interested in this game, please add it to your watch list and wishlist—it means a lot to me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/4f45e483263098d19cefcf756e62624e.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/4f45e483263098d19cefcf756e62624e.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this age of a global viral outbreak, you are the next generation human of the “Alpha” Project, the hope for humanity's future. You are deployed to the frontlines of the zombie tide to reignite the hope of human survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/d5b4b628a106fb5802e40441b25c9fe9.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/d5b4b628a106fb5802e40441b25c9fe9.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lengthy storylines, no repetitive cutscenes. Step into this adventurous post-apocalyptic world. Choose your favorite character and pick up your preferred weapon! This is a game everyone will enjoy. Whether you're experienced or new to gaming, simply move, choose, and decide to experience the recurring joy of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/c9bc280fabae8f820c3c3f296e0975b1.avif?t=1780407121\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/1c12c35d74e0a58bb4f26c17a42a446a.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/1c12c35d74e0a58bb4f26c17a42a446a.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone hero, equipped with various talents and support skills. You can either focus on your favorite character to change their gear and unlock their ultimate abilities. How you combine your equipment and find your own preferred playstyle will be the challenge this post-apocalyptic world presents to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/2f879c78fd4e075366cf7ad5c8c95746.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a stoic warrior. He specializes in using katanas, pistols, and assault rifles. By traveling through a rift in time and space, he has gained dark powers, allowing him to wield unique moves with his katana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/76e8ec53319fbcaf38a6a591ff453244.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a wild warrior.and the grenade launcher is his favorite. Only he can use this heavy weapon, and his physical enhancement allows him to fire it in rapid succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/938c909144c266ffeecb6509289d5abb.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is agile and quick, excelling at launching surprise attacks. Proficient with daggers and automatic rapid-fire pistols, she is a highly-trained assassin whose specialty is throwing all kinds of throwing knives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a6ffcfac01f6db973fb7b7fe68e44398.avif?t=1780407121\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is exceptionally talented, possessing strength and a desire for conquest that surpasses that of men. She specializes in using revolvers and sniper rifles. Additionally, she knows how to use two revolvers simultaneously, and after her body is enhanced, she can fire a rapid round at all surrounding enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/238a392782c71233247954ed18bd23ed.avif?t=1780407121\" width=310 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She possesses a formidable constitution, endowed with health and mana far exceeding ordinary limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A master of the baseball bat and semi-auto pistol, she can electrify her baseballs with lightning to unleash devastating damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eccentric at heart, she refuses to be summoned as a follower to fight for others, but can learn talents to convert damage or reflect enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/5f6a4291bc5801a049638cd1e6ab6abd.avif?t=1780407121\" width=310 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a martial artist passionate about creating art, which may sound hard to comprehend. But when you learn about his fighting style, you'll understand. Every punch carries gale-force winds. His modified enhanced arm can fire bullets, allowing him to summon sharks on flat ground. He also experiments with a flamethrower, beloved by everyone in the post-apocalyptic world. His name is not Joker—he is Rugal, a hero who hopes to bring laughter to the end times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/974ecedd20c70e6c0a493744b47affac.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/974ecedd20c70e6c0a493744b47affac.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery Store:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Players can purchase equipment with random attributes through a mysterious figure. The quality of the equipment improves as the difficulty level of the game is increased. With sufficient currency, players can obtain better equipment, which gradually helps to enhance their progress in clearing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c97e6c7d2f5c4691e220495f31f489d.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/9c97e6c7d2f5c4691e220495f31f489d.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip Manufacturing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Players can manufacture chips that enhance attributes. These chips can be equipped onto weapons, significantly boosting the character's attributes. This makes character development much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/37d49b6e71a5e186c57d53f4c7d55e1f.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/37d49b6e71a5e186c57d53f4c7d55e1f.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Modification:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Players can modify equipment using specific items. Equipment can not only be drilled for sockets but also have their other attributes enhanced. When players obtain the desired equipment, they can purposefully upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/b02f0764781b526246bdf74892145715.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/b02f0764781b526246bdf74892145715.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Players can create multiple characters and can also change the names of these characters. By creating multiple characters, players can use their talents to allow these saved characters to follow the main character in battle and fight zombies in a random manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a1a6da103d74a53eb3bcf2918235bfd6.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/a1a6da103d74a53eb3bcf2918235bfd6.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Each character can fill up their talent tree. Talent points are earned from completing tasks, killing zombies, collecting boxes, and purchasing items. The talents of different characters will vary slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c527afd85b28fdcb6cb7d43693573e2.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/9c527afd85b28fdcb6cb7d43693573e2.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Characters can carry two different weapons, a single weapon, or two weapons of the same type, with different combinations yielding varied combat effects.<br>Melee: Can perform two attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/44b85454447191f65199c5eb7b152389.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged: Can accumulate chip energy faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/43a9afc3386167c16ebed2a18ebeab4c.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/43a9afc3386167c16ebed2a18ebeab4c.avif?t=1780407121 width=1560 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. As you progress through increasingly challenging levels, more powerful enemies will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/b04f9a27c83dd90ca9d763fecc1a7402.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>8. By defeating enemies or scavenging the battlefield, you can obtain equipment with different attributes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/66fef2468748edde4b97978af54e18db.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Upgrading grants random skills. Guardian skills differ from those of followers, as they can absorb damage dealt by nearby enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/14939a007e41775618967cde6e0627b2.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Embedding crafted chips can further enhance character attribute strength or equip additional talent skills and unexpected chip skills, unleashing greater damage by accumulating energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/2ecabed71e7afb68e2f7bbbe88dbae36.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11.Unknown area exploration is generated by a fully random mechanism. Challenge zones of different sizes by consuming fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/fe1aa062f117d34b7dffb09d11877c54.avif?t=1780407121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/ca02fcb00b461d78e1663e5935717105.avif?t=1780407121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras_big/ca02fcb00b461d78e1663e5935717105.avif?t=1780407121 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially, we were a small team of close friends who wanted to create the kind of gameplay we loved and share it with everyone. Although my friends are still supporting me, the team has now become just me. However, I don’t see this as a sad thing. It has truly become an independent development effort. Over the past few months, I’ve continued to maintain my initial passion and gradually improved the game. I will keep developing it. I believe this won’t be my last independent game, and I will continue to create more games in the future. If you have any ideas about the direction of my game design, we look forward to your feedback on my Discord. If you are interested in this game, please add it to your watch list and wishlist—it means a lot to me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "As the savior of the apocalypse, take up your weapons and unleash your powers. Rescue survivors, confront waves of zombies, and through relentless searching, become an immortal warrior. Write your own glorious legend in this plague-ridden hell.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/5742a34855b38152f5d446c2aaff1833718880ce/header.jpg?t=1780407121", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/b2486f9bbe1362ac2cbbe54c6a2cb5b3beb74a2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780407121", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/b2486f9bbe1362ac2cbbe54c6a2cb5b3beb74a2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780407121", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 / AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["The Last One"], "publishers": ["cuixiaosen"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 899, "final": 899, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$8.99"}, "packages": [1229538], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Apocalypse Survivors", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1229538, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Apocalypse Survivors - $8.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 899}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}]