10e30fae2d81a6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780407121"}, {"id": 6, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/ss_fc9ecdd0a85068c84bf07cafac9abed43ae84c66.600x338.jpg?t=1780407121", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/ss_fc9ecdd0a85068c84bf07cafac9abed43ae84c66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780407121"}, {"id": 7, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/ss_dde58d6b7305d60357d61cead82507475a3454d6.600x338.jpg?t=1780407121", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/ss_dde58d6b7305d60357d61cead82507475a3454d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780407121"}, {"id": 8, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/ss_84d6a8d78c4eb1058d456aa38a84191a4099ce9b.600x338.jpg?t=1780407121", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/ss_84d6a8d78c4eb1058d456aa38a84191a4099ce9b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780407121"}, {"id": 9, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/6fb6a08678e6942decead87112ade63ddf10f8a4/ss_6fb6a08678e6942decead87112ade63ddf10f8a4.600x338.jpg?t=1780407121", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/6fb6a08678e6942decead87112ade63ddf10f8a4/ss_6fb6a08678e6942decead87112ade63ddf10f8a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780407121"}, {"id": 10, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/bfe74bda3e8ed2117873327d59abb34021e62835/ss_bfe74bda3e8ed2117873327d59abb34021e62835.600x338.jpg?t=1780407121", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/bfe74bda3e8ed2117873327d59abb34021e62835/ss_bfe74bda3e8ed2117873327d59abb34021e62835.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780407121"}, {"id": 11, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/34